flowchart TD
    OTP["Hash of our public key<br/>burned once into the chip's OTP memory"] --> BL["Boot ROM and EEPROM bootloader"]
    BL -->|"checks the signature"| IMG["Signed boot image<br/>kernel, system and endpoint"]
    IMG -->|"valid"| RUN["Pi boots"]
    IMG -->|"modified or unsigned"| HALT["Pi refuses to boot"]
